---
import demo from '../data/gwas-demo.json';
const width=720,height=330,left=64,right=680,top=24,bottom=260;
const maxValue=Math.ceil(Math.max(...demo.rows.map(r=>-Math.log10(r.p)),demo.threshold));
const y=(v:number)=>bottom-(v/maxValue)*(bottom-top);
const x=(v:number)=>left+(v/maxValue)*(right-left);
const points=demo.rows.map((r,i)=>({x:left+(i/(demo.markers-1))*(right-left),y:y(-Math.log10(r.p)),...r}));
---
<section class="gwas-demo" aria-labelledby="gwas-title"><h2 id="gwas-title">模拟 GWAS 结果图</h2><p>固定种子 20261121 生成 80 个虚构样本和 60 个 SNP，表型由一个模拟位点与随机噪声产生。逐标记线性回归的双侧检验结果用于下面两幅图；没有加入群体结构或亲缘协变量。</p><div class="buttons"><button type="button" data-gwas="manhattan" aria-pressed="true">Manhattan 图</button> <button type="button" data-gwas="qq" aria-pressed="false">QQ 图</button> <button type="button" data-gwas="reset">重置</button></div><div class="stage"><svg viewBox={`0 0 ${width} ${height}`} role="img" aria-labelledby="gwas-svg-title gwas-svg-desc"><title id="gwas-svg-title">模拟 GWAS 的 Manhattan 图与 QQ 图</title><desc id="gwas-svg-desc">按钮切换按染色体显示的标记 P 值与观察、预期 P 值分位数，数据为固定随机种子生成的教学模拟。</desc><g id="gwas-manhattan"><path d={`M${left} ${top}V${bottom}H${right}`} fill="none" stroke="#879aa6" stroke-width="2"/><path d={`M${left} ${y(demo.threshold)}H${right}`} stroke="#a96550" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"/>{points.map(p=><circle cx={p.x} cy={p.y} r="4" fill={p.chromosome%2?'#197b73':'#397ba0'}><title>模拟染色体 {p.chromosome}，位置序号 {p.position}，P={p.p.toExponential(3)}</title></circle>)}<g fill="#17324d" font-size="15"><text x="10" y="30">−log₁₀(P)</text><text x="38" y={bottom+5}>0</text><text x="28" y={top+5}>{maxValue}</text><text x="270" y="303">模拟染色体与标记顺序 →</text></g></g><g id="gwas-qq" visibility="hidden"><path d={`M${left} ${top}V${bottom}H${right}`} fill="none" stroke="#879aa6" stroke-width="2"/><path d={`M${x(0)} ${y(0)}L${x(maxValue)} ${y(maxValue)}`} stroke="#a96550" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"/>{demo.qq.map(p=><circle cx={x(p.expected)} cy={y(p.observed)} r="4" fill="#197b73"><title>预期 {p.expected.toFixed(3)}，观察 {p.observed.toFixed(3)}</title></circle>)}<g fill="#17324d" font-size="15"><text x="8" y="30">观察 −log₁₀(P)</text><text x="35" y={bottom+5}>0</text><text x="28" y={top+5}>{maxValue}</text><text x="270" y="303">预期 −log₁₀(P) →</text><text x={right-20} y={bottom+22}>{maxValue}</text></g></g></svg></div><p id="gwas-explanation" aria-live="polite">Manhattan 图按三个模拟染色体排列标记；虚线为 0.05/60 的 Bonferroni 阈值。</p><p>QQ 图中的预期分位数使用 $(i-0.5)/60$，两轴采用相同刻度；虚线表示相等。模拟模型及输出可用项目脚本重新计算，不能作为植物性状研究结果。</p></section>
<script>
for(const button of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-gwas]'))button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const mode=button.dataset.gwas==='reset'?'manhattan':button.dataset.gwas!;document.querySelector('#gwas-manhattan')?.setAttribute('visibility',mode==='manhattan'?'visible':'hidden');document.querySelector('#gwas-qq')?.setAttribute('visibility',mode==='qq'?'visible':'hidden');const label=document.querySelector('#gwas-explanation');if(label)label.textContent=mode==='manhattan'?'Manhattan 图按三个模拟染色体排列标记；虚线为 0.05/60 的 Bonferroni 阈值。':'QQ 图比较排序后的观察 P 值与预期分位数；尾部偏离在此示例中包含人为设置的信号。';for(const item of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-gwas]'))if(item.dataset.gwas!=='reset')item.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(item.dataset.gwas===mode));});
</script>
<style>.gwas-demo{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:#f8fbfa;border-radius:12px;margin:32px 0}.stage{overflow-x:auto}.stage svg{width:100%;min-width:650px;height:auto}.gwas-demo p{font-size:.9rem}.gwas-demo button{margin:4px}.gwas-demo button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--teal);color:#fff}</style>
